; Willow, for bout(1).  Quick, and tells for barely long enough.  Two
; high in a row, then a low, so counting is worth as much as watching.

name Willow
health 18
reach 52

%

state open
	hurt reel
	wait 26
	tell high 13
	strike high 3
	recover 18
	tell high 13
	strike high 3
	recover 18
	tell low 15
	strike low 4
	recover 22
	goto open

state reel
	wait 24
	goto open
